  (text "Blocks 1-2: USB-C (power + data), TP4057 charger with charge pause"
    (at 14 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 4f088931-ad80-5654-b9dd-a6a376c30541)
  )
  (text "Block 3: cell pads, 3.3 V LDO, VBUS-edge reset" (at 14 160 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 16af1768-be99-5886-8251-2f3099a65559)
  )
  (text "Block 4: synchronous buck LED driver with cascaded current loop"
    (at 154 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 31109714-d5ba-5559-9eec-32894fc8880a)
  )
  (text "Block 5: laser load switch with hardware interlock (gate path)"
    (at 154 160 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 76b8dee2-553f-5c46-b094-e50a64020ee8)
  )
  (text "Block 6: ESP32-C3-MINI-1 (BLE, USB), 3-button ladder, RGB ring LEDs, NTC, VBAT sense"
    (at 294 22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 2560e9d6-4244-5d82-8383-1958318f4dbd)
  )
  (text "USB-C: Rd 5.1 k on CC1 and CC2 (5 V sink). D+/D- go to the ESP32-C3 native USB (flashing, console).\nTP4057: R3 3.3 k returns PROG to CHG_SET (GPIO20): low = approx. 280 mA, floating = 10 mA trickle via R29,\nhigh = charger off (only while USB is present). CHRG/STDBY are read by GPIO4/GPIO5 (internal pull-ups)."
    (at 14 142 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid d0b9d1ba-3500-5b91-bcd0-8b3f0b942a7a)
  )
  (text "J2: two LP601646 cells in parallel (two wires per pad): red = BAT+ (pin 1), black = BAT- (pin 2).\nU5 RT9080: 3.3 V, EN tied to VIN, 2 uA quiescent.  Q5/C17/R7: plugging in USB pulls EN low for approx. 0.1 s,\nso the module restarts; holding the button (GPIO9 strap) while plugging in starts the ROM download mode."
    (at 14 268 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 15149f63-403c-544d-816f-3e85597ed448)
  )
  (text "VOUT = 0.6 V (1 + R10/R11) = 1.8 V with Q2 off; Q2 sinks current from FB, VOUT rises until I_LED x RS1 = VSET.\nVSET = duty(GPIO6, 13-bit PWM) x 3.3 V x R16/(R15+R16): 100 % = 64.7 mV = 3.23 A.  U3 is powered from LED_EN.\nKelvin: R14 from the top of RS1; R16, C12 and U3 pin 2 return to RS1's ground pad."
    (at 154 142 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 32d288ff-2a8d-5ff6-94e3-bc254d16189f)
  )
  (text "S2 SAFE (pin 3) ties the Q1 gate to VBAT; ARMED (pin 1) gives Q4 / LASER_ON (GPIO10) control.\nS2 never carries laser current. R18 keeps Q1 off and R20 keeps Q4 off while the MCU is in reset."
    (at 154 277 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid cf8f7fc6-7452-5f04-8134-ad0405e5313c)
  )
  (text "GPIO map:\nIO0 VBAT/2 - IO1 NTC - IO2/IO8/IO21 RGB B/G/R (active low, two ring LEDs)\nIO3+IO9 button ladder (IO9 digital any-press + boot strap, IO3 ADC)\nIO4 CHRG - IO5 STDBY - IO6 LED_PWM - IO7 LED_EN - IO10 LASER_ON\nIO18/IO19 USB D-/D+ - IO20 CHG_SET.  Antenna beyond the board edge."
    (at 336 30 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 3bd01dac-f636-58b2-b9bf-aa0d238b2134)
  )
  (text "LED: Luminus SST-20 on a ready-made 10 mm DTP copper board,\nLED+ to J3.1 (top side), LED- to J3.2 (bottom side), 28 AWG PTFE."
    (at 232 58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 8e809786-cd7e-5bb5-a7c2-1686b778dcc7)
  )

